{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>WARNING: This game contains some scenes with flashing lights and may not be suitable for players with light sensitivity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a short demo of <i><strong>Obfuscation</strong></i> \u2014 a first-person psychological horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo purpose is to showcase early gameplay concepts and the environmental direction of the full game.\u00a0This demo is not connected to the main game's story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Scenario</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the middle of a rainstorm, you enter a house. You don\u2019t know where you are or who you are - but one thing is certain: this isn\u2019t your home.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722270/extras/gif1.gif?t=1747051116\" /> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an twisting environment that keeps you on edge, and encounter unsettling paranormal phenomena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo offers a linear experience, emphasizing atmosphere to evoke fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722270/extras/gif3.gif?t=1747051116\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You're the best!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3722270/d9256adfa6ed75928c8d248ed5487c66107260fd.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722270?t=1747051116","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722270/886ee67f20f884a5f07be771202996724e1893e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747051116","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722270/23a4e10e0d1aa178e9de916c6092956a4f96fc17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747051116","cap